WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.460
The first and the hub of education was McKinley Senior High School.

2
00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:08.140
That was the only school for African Americans.

3
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:15.425
We had kids coming from Clinton, St. Francisville, Port Allen, Brusly, all around [Louisiana] coming to Baton Rouge.

4
00:00:15.425 --> 00:00:17.560
There was no other high school for black folks.
